#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Introduction {#1-introduction}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Throughout this lesson, we will examine noise and how it can be mitigated on"
" quantum computers. We will begin by looking at the effects of noise using a"
" simulator that can simulate noise in a few ways, including using noise "
"profiles from real quantum computers. Then we will move on to real quantum "
"computers, in which noise is inherent. We will look at the effects of error "
"mitigation, including combinations of things like zero-noise extrapolation "
"(ZNE) and gate-twirling.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We will start by loading some packages.\n"
msgstr ""

